<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet</book>
  <para style="h">Efeson</para>
  <para style="toc2">Efeson</para>
  <para style="toc1">Efeson Maants</para>
  <para style="toc3">Efe.</para>
  <para style="mt3">Wosheetso P'awlos Wosho</para>
  <para style="mt">Efeson Ashuwots Maants</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">P'awlos Efeson dats ashuwotssh b́ guut'ts wosh jamoniyere shino b́ t'iwintsir «Ik'o b́ k'umtso b́wotit daronat datsatse fa'a azeets jamo kakweyar Krstos s'uz shirots bowotit aawo b́bodore» (1:10) etiru asaabiyatsne. Aaninwere Iyesus Krstosnton ik wotde'er ash naar jamo iko bowotitwok'o k'umts enan finats bo jitsitwok'o Ik' ashuwotssh gawiyetkee.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ephesonsh wosheets wosh shints kayo guut'tso ik woti jango dek' b́twtso gawintsdek't, Ik'o niho bíashwotsi aawk'on galb́dek'tsok'o, b́ naay Iyesus Krstosn bomorrosh orowa eto daatsr aawk'on bos'ayinetwok'onat Ik'o een wotts b́ jángiyits aap'o shayiri S'ayini weeron aawk'on ariko b́bek'shtsok'oni b́kitsiri, Gitli kayotse ando aani guut'tso nababirwots ikwotde bobewotse Krstosn bodetsts ikwoto arik b́wotitwok'owa boosh b́gawiyir.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ashuwots Krstosnton bodetsts ik woton aawk'o ik woto bodetstsok'o k'osh k'osh jewri keewon kitsere, Ik' moowu atsok'o b́ wotor Krstos atsatsi tokok'owiye, Ik' moowu mook'o b́ wotor Krstos b gúratsi shúts eenok'owiye, Ik' moowu moogenk'o b́ wotor K'rtos moodonzk'owiye, wosh han guut'tso Krstos weeron be'ets Ik' deero ayidek't adt b́ keewor dashan gop'at wok wotts kitsone b́ bek'shiri, jam keewono b́ s'iilir Krstos shunone, b́ tooko beshide'er b́ imon, b́ maac' k'ewon, b́ deeronat b́ jenok'one.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">Kindo 1:1-2</para>
  <para style="io1">Krstosnat Ik' moon 1:3—3:21</para>
  <para style="io1">Krstosn andr beyo 4:1—6:20</para>
  <para style="io1">B́ gúúpo 6:21-24</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:19-21">Wosh. 18:19-21</ref> </char>
    </note> Ik' shunon Iyesus Krstossh woshek wottso P'awlosoke, Iyesus Krstosn amanek wottswots, Efesonitse beyiru S'ayinwotssh.<verse eid="EPH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2"/>No nihi Ik'onat nodoonz Iyesus Krstosokere s'aatonat jeenon itsh wotowe.<verse eid="EPH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Krstosn daatseyiru shayiri deero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3"/>Darotse fa'a shayiri deer jamo Krstosn noon deertso no doonz Iyesus Krstos nihi Ik'o údewe. <verse eid="EPH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4"/>S'ayinonat eeg eego deshawwotsi wotaarr b́ shinatse nodaatsetwok'o datsu b́ azeftsere Krstos weeron noon gal b́dek'i.<verse eid="EPH 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5"/>Ik'o b́ geetso sheeng keew b́ wottsotse Iyesus Krstos finon b́ nanaúwotskok'o no wotish bale noon marat'b́dek'i. <verse eid="EPH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6"/>Hanowere b́ k'al b́shune na'o weeron beenon noosh b́ imts mang wotts s'aato b́ úditwok'owe. <verse eid="EPH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:14">K'ol. 1:14</ref> </char></note> Ik' s'aati s'eenatse tuutson b́ naay s'atson keeweyat no morrosh orowa eto daatsrone. <verse eid="EPH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8"/>B́ s'aatono ayidek't noosh kuut're, danonat dani teleefonowere, <verse eid="EPH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9"/>Ik'o b́ shuntso Krstos weeron bali b́ k'úmtsok'on ááshat teshts b́shunman no danetwok'o woshre. <verse eid="EPH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10"/>Dúri s'uwi aawo b́ bodor Ik'o finats b́ jitsts b́ k'úmtsman daronat datsatse beyiru azeets jamwots ko'ide'er ik s'uzo Krstos shirots bo wotitwok'o b́ woshiti.<verse eid="EPH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11"/>Jam keewo b́ took shunok'on finiru Ik'o bali b́ k'úmtsok'on Krstos weeron b́ jirwotsi no wotitwok'o noon marat'b́dek'i. <verse eid="EPH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12"/>Man b́wotwere Krstosi jángon shintswotsi wottswots noo Ik'o b́mangosh no úditwok'owe.<verse eid="EPH 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13"/>It it kashosh doo shishi aap' wottso ari aap'o it shishor Krstosi it amani, mank'o bí itsh imosh jangit b́ teshts S'ayin shayri matabo itats togk'rere. <verse eid="EPH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14"/>Shayiranwere b́ mango údosh b́ wotitwok'o Ik'o bík wotts jamwotsi b́ kashifetsosh nodaatsit naatosh dets nodek'tsoniye.<verse eid="EPH 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Efeson ashuwotssh Ik'o b́k'ontsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15"/>Eshe doonzo Iyesusatse it detsts imnetiyonat S'ayin jamwotssh it detsts shuno shishat, <verse eid="EPH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16"/>itn Ik' k'onon gawfetsat it jangosh Ik'osh údo t'intso need'iratse. <verse eid="EPH 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17"/>Mango bísh wotitwo no doonz Iyesus Krstos nihi Ik'o ayide'er it danetwok'o dani teleefonat bek'i shayiro itsh b́ imetwok'o Ik'o k'onitwe. <verse eid="EPH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18"/>Aaw naari jangosh it s'egetsok'onat S'ayinwots bo naatet mang wotts ristiyo aawk'o ayi b́ wotok'o it danetwok'o it nibi ááwo b́ sháánetwok'o Ik'o k'onitwe. <verse eid="EPH 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Dub. 110:1</ref> </char></note> Tatsdeshaw bí angi eeno noosh amanirúwotssh aawk'o een b́ wotok'o it danetwok'o Ik'o k'onitwe, <verse eid="EPH 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20"/>Bí anigi eenano finats b́jiitsi k'irotse tuzdek't darotse b́ k'ano maants b́ beeztso Krstosne. <verse eid="EPH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21"/>Ik'o niho Krstosi darotse b́ k'ano maants b́ beez aaw naari alguroniyre, aloniyere, naashoniyere, angoniyere, doonzwottsonat shúúts jamoniyere damb aaninwere datsan s'uzats b́ woterawo weet datswatsnorniye. <verse eid="EPH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Dub. 8:6</ref> </char></note> Jam keewo b́ aali shirots woshdek't bísh b́keewiyi, Ik' maatsnowere jamoniyere damb b́ wotitwok'o tooko bín b́ woshi. <verse eid="EPH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22-23 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:18">K'ol. 1:18</ref> </char></note> Ik' moowniye bí atsuniye, jamó b́ jamon s'eentsitwo bín s'eenon kiitsitwaniye.<verse eid="EPH 1:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2"/>
  <para style="s">K'irotse kasho maants k'ay kími jango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1"/>It it daadonat it morri jangosh it shayiri beyon k'irk itne it teshi, <verse eid="EPH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2"/>Manoor datsanatsi gond sha'ok'owa it sha'efoni, aaninwere jongatse fa'a shayiri angwotsi keewirwosha it alefoni, bíwere and azazeraw ashuwotsatse finiru kim shayironiye. <verse eid="EPH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3"/>Nó jametswere haniye shinon bo dagotse no meets shunok'onat no maac' gawirwo shoydek'at sha'at no meets tewnok'o beyaatniye no teshi, k'oshwotskok'o no azeewon Ik' fayi shirotsne noteshi.<verse eid="EPH 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4"/>Ernmó Ik' maac' k'ewo ay b́ wottsonat noosh b́ detsts shuno een b́ wottsatse tuutson, <verse eid="EPH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5"/>No morron k'irk nowotiyaloru Ik'o Krstosnton kashetswotsi no wotitwok'o woshre, it kashwere b́ s'aatone. <verse eid="EPH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6"/>Ik'o Iyesus Krstosnton k'irotse tuuzt daritsi beyokoke bínton noon b́beezi. <verse eid="EPH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7"/>Han b́k'alwere Krstos Iyesusn noosh k'eshdek't b́kiitsts doowonat bínton nutsiyetwo deshawo s'aati gaalo weet dúrwotsitse noosh kitsosha etniye. <verse eid="EPH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8"/>It it kash imneti weeron wotts s'aatone, manwere Ik' ima bako itokikaliye. <verse eid="EPH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9"/>Konwor asho b́ id'aawok'owa, kashiyit s'aato b́daatse finonaliye, <verse eid="EPH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10"/>Noo Ik'o bal b́k'anits sheengo finefetsr nobetuwok'o Krstos Iyesus weeron aaniyi azeets Ik'i aztswots noone.<verse eid="EPH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Krstosn daatset ikwoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11"/>Mansh eshe, bal it shwewon Ik'i ash woterawwotsi it teshtsok'o, Ayhdiwots ash kishon gofo boamtsosh it'fetst itsh gof amawwotsi ett boc'ashfok'o, <verse eid="EPH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12"/>it Israe'el ashuwotsnton gonke deshawwots, Ik'o bí ashuwotssh b́jangitswtsats need'iyets aap'i taarwotssho ib wottswots, datsanatsnowere it jangiru ik keewalonat Ik'alon beyirwots, manorowere Krstosatse wokat it teshtsok'o gawde'ere. <verse eid="EPH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13"/>Andmó it haniyere shin wokat teshtswots Krstos Iyesusn wotdek'at b́s'atson t'inrte. <verse eid="EPH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14"/>Noon k'ált teshtso fayi girgido b́meetson gáákt Ayhdiwotsnat Ik'i ash woterawwotsn ik woshtso nojeeno Krstosiye. <verse eid="EPH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15"/>Git jirmanotsitse bínton ikwotitwo ik handr asho azosh Muse nemi tzaziyonat b́ niwwotsi gaakt jeeno b́woshi. <verse eid="EPH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16"/>Mask'aliyatse k'irtnwere s'aaleyar beyo k'aaúbazre, gitetswtsnowere ik atso woshdek't Ik'onton maniree. <verse eid="EPH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 57:19">Isa. 57:19</ref> </char></note> Waatnwere, wokat teshtswotssh itnat karnt teshts ayhudiwotsshowere jeen dooshiy aap'o nabre. <verse eid="EPH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18"/>Bíyatse tuutson no gitetswor ik shayiron jisheyr nihok t'inetwone.<verse eid="EPH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19"/>Mansh eshe it S'ayinwotsnton ik datsi ashuwotsnat Ik'i maa ashuwots itna bako haniyere okoon ibonat ashdatsi ashuwots itnaliye. <verse eid="EPH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20"/>Woshetswotsnat nebiywotsn need'itsats agerte, ageyiru maamansh tungúshatse shutswotse kaatsde detset shúts kup'o Iyesus Krstosiye. <verse eid="EPH 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21"/>Maa eenmanu b́ jamon bín ikok desheyarr doonzo S'ayin Ik' moo wotarr eenetwe. <verse eid="EPH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22"/>Ik'o b́ shayiron bíts b́ beet moo wotosh itwere Krstosn tohaar ageetute.<verse eid="EPH 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3"/>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Ik' ash woterawwotssh b́ fintsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1"/>Itsh Ik' ash wotserawwotssha etaatni taa P'awlos Krstos Iyesussh tipetso t woti. <verse eid="EPH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2"/>Itsh t sheengshitwok'o Ik'o b́ s'aaton fini gowo taash b́ imtsok'o arikon shishrte. <verse eid="EPH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3"/>Bal k'awnon itsh t guut'etsok'o Ik'o ááshts man taash k'eshdek't kitsre. <verse eid="EPH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4"/>Itsh t guut'tsan it nababor Krstosko ááshts keewo taa t t'iwintstsok'o danosh falfte. <verse eid="EPH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5"/>Ááshts keewanwere Ik' shayiron S'ayin woshetswotsnat nebiyiwotssh and b́ be'etsok'on beshts dúrwotsatse teshts ashuwotssh be'eratse. <verse eid="EPH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4-6 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:26-27">K'ol. 1:26-27</ref> </char></note> Manwere b́ kitsir Ik' ash woterawwots ayhudiyotsnton b́ rstiyo naatetuwotsnat ik atsi kaywotsi wotar Ik'o b́ imts jangosh dooshishi weeron Krstos Iyesusnton kayitwotsi bo wottsoniye.<verse eid="EPH 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7"/>Ik'o b́ angi finon taash b́ imts s'aaton taawere doo shishiyansh finru guutso wotere. <verse eid="EPH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8"/>Taa S'ayin wotts jamwotsiyere t múk'iyaloru dab́ daar deshaw Krstos gaalo manwere doo shishiyo Ik' ash woterawwotssh t shishiish Ik' s'aato taash b́ imi. <verse eid="EPH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9"/>Mank'o beshts dur jamwotsatse jam azts Ik'on ááshat teshts Ik'o b́ beeztso eeg b́ wotok'o jamosh t kitsitwok'o s'aato taash imere. <verse eid="EPH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10"/>Manwere b́ wot and dúranatse Ik' maa weeron daaratse fa'a alirwotsnat naashwotsn Ik' dan teleefo bí ar arok'on bo danetwok'owe. <verse eid="EPH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11"/>Ik'o no doonz Krstos Iyesusn han findek't b́s'eents dúre dúrosh b́ k'úmtsok'one. <verse eid="EPH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12"/>Krstosk no wottsonat bín no amantsosh Ik' shinatse ááwu shúk'onat imneityon t'inosh falfone. <verse eid="EPH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13"/>Taa it jangosh t dek'iru gond bek'o it mangoshee b́ wotiti, mansh t gond bek'i jangatse tuutson it ango b́neferawok'owa etaat itn k'onirwe.<verse eid="EPH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Krstos shuno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14"/>Eshe Ik'o Niho shinats t gubron tuk'umalde'k'aat Ik'o t k'onir han jangoshe. <verse eid="EPH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15"/>Daronat datsatse fa'a ik ik maa asho koni b́ wottsok'o b́ daatsit Ik'okne. <verse eid="EPH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16"/>Ik'o it gitsitsi atso kúp'shit ango b́ shayiri weeron b́ mangi gaalon b́ imetwok'o Ik'o k'onitwe. <verse eid="EPH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17"/>Mank'owere Krstos imnetiyon it nibots b́ betwok'onat itwere s'ap'ar shunon kúp' it wotitwok'o Ik'o k'onitwe. <verse eid="EPH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18"/>Ando aani Krstos shuno b́ gaawnonat b́ genzon, danmban b́ tuwonat dashan b́ gop'on, awúk'o b́ wotok'o S'ayin jamwotsnton s'eenon t'iwintso falr, <verse eid="EPH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19"/>ash danoniyere bog wotts Krstos shuno it danetwok'o Ik'o b́ s'een jamon s'eenosh it bodetwok'o Ik'o k'onitwe.<verse eid="EPH 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20"/>Eshe mansh noyitse finirwo bí'angi weeron nok'onirwonat nogawirwoniyere danmb ayide'er bogshde k'alo falitwo Ik'o Izar Izewer, <verse eid="EPH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21"/>bísh Ik'i moonat Krstos Iyesusn dúr jamon dúre dúrosh mango wotowe!, Amen.<verse eid="EPH 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Atso ik b́wotok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1"/>Eshe doonzosh t fintsosh tipeets wottso taa, it s'eegets s'eegosh geyik wotts beewon it beetwok'o itn k'onirwe. <verse eid="EPH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 3:12-13">K'ol. 3:12-13</ref> </char></note> Shunon it took tookon k'amefetsr tooko dashan detson maac' nefonat faleyon beewere,. <verse eid="EPH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3"/>Jeenon it atsatseyo deshede'er Ik' shayirotse daatseyiru ik woto kotosh kúp'owere. <verse eid="EPH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4"/>It s'eegeyor ik jángosh it s'eegetsok'o ik atsonat ik shayiro fa'ee. <verse eid="EPH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5"/>Aaninuwere doonz iko, imneti ikonat gup iko fa'ee. <verse eid="EPH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6"/>Dabnwere jamoniyere damb wottso, jamotse wotde finitwo, jamotse beetwo, jamosh nih wottso ik Ik'o Izar Izewer fa'ee.<verse eid="EPH 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7"/>Ernmó Krstos imosh bí ettsok'o bodtso no took tookosh s'aati imo noosh imere. <verse eid="EPH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 68:18">Dub. 68:18</ref> </char></note> Mansh S'ayin mas'afotsere,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">«Damb b́keshor mus'o mus'dek'tni bí'ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">Ashuwotsshowere imuwotsi b́ imi» eteetsok'owiye.<verse eid="EPH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9"/>Beree «Dambaan b́ keshi» etiru aap'an shini shin datso maants, datsotsnoru ayidek't dashan wotts beyok b́ ot'tsoni bako k'osho eebi b́ kitsiri? <verse eid="EPH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10"/>Dashan ot'tsanwere bí jamo s'eenosh dar jamoniyere damb keshtsoniye. <verse eid="EPH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11"/>Bíwere ik ikwotsi wosheetso, ik ikwotsi bek'etswotsi, ik ikwotsi doo shishiyo nabitwotsi, ik ikwotsi amantsuwotsi jinetwotsi, ik ikwots danitwotsi bowotitwok'o imuwotsi boosh b́ imi. <verse eid="EPH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12"/>Hanowere b́ k'al amantswotsi kirstani finosh k'anir Krstos ats wotts Ik' moowu bi agetuwok'owe. <verse eid="EPH 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13"/>Ando Ik' na'o danon imnetiyon daatseyiru ik wotok bodroone, Krstos s'ayinonat s'een b́ wottsok'o noowere ik wotde s'een asho no wotitwok'owe. <verse eid="EPH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14"/>Haniyere okoon ashuwots gondonat ant'elcosh k'andek'ts dani jongonat aats fundon hake bako gifnide'er daamet nanaúwotskok'o woteratsone. <verse eid="EPH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15"/>Dab maniyere aro shunon keewfetsr jam keewon took wottso Krstos maants eenetwone. <verse eid="EPH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 2:19">K'ol. 2:19</ref> </char></note> K'osh k'osh atsi kaywots bodesh Krstosne, ats jamonwere ikok b́ deshee shas'wotsne, eshe ik ik atsi kayo bísh eteets fin sheengshde'er b́ finor ats jamo bí eneti, shunonowere b́ kup'iti.<verse eid="EPH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Krstosn daatset handr beyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17"/>Haniyakon, k'awntsalkeew gawirw Ik' ash woterawwotskok'o beek'ayere etaat doonzo shútson it tooko kor it dek'etwok'o itsh keewre, <verse eid="EPH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18"/>Bo asaabiyo t'aluwtskee, bodaronat bo k'elikúp'i jangosh Ik'o boosh bí imts beyatse k'alernee. <verse eid="EPH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19"/>Jitso bot'ut'tsosh kim jamo k'alosh bo tewnirwotse botoko meets tewunosh beshidek't imrne. <verse eid="EPH 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20"/>Itmó Krstos jango hank'owaliye it dani, <verse eid="EPH 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21"/>Arikon b́ jango shishrte, aronwere Iyesusitse b́ fa'ok'o bín danrte, <verse eid="EPH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 3:9">K'ol. 3:9</ref> </char></note> Mansh antelchde'er morro maants jishit Woteraw tewno shini bín it beyiru nat wotts it azeets doyo okaan juu bayere. <verse eid="EPH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23"/>It nibonat asaabiyon b́ jamon handr wotowe, <verse eid="EPH 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Aze. 1:26</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:10">K'ol. 3:10</ref> </char></note> Arik wotts kááwonat S'ayinon Ik' arok'on azeetso handr atso tahade'ere.<verse eid="EPH 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ZEC 8:16">Zek. 8:16</ref> </char>
    </note> Eshe kooto keewk'ayere, no jamets ik atsi kaywotsi no wottsotse no ats atsewo ari keewo keewwone. <verse eid="EPH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 4:4">Dub. 4:4</ref> </char></note> Fayore! it fayonomo morro fink'ayere, it fayetsok'on it befere aawo ilk'aye. <verse eid="EPH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27"/>Dablossh b́ kindit fúro imk'ayere. <verse eid="EPH 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28"/>Ump'irwo haniyak úmp'k'aye, dab kic'tswotssh b́ imish gizo b́ daatsitwok'o b́ kishon sheeng fino finowe. <verse eid="EPH 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29"/>B́ jamon it nonotse woteraw keewo keshk'aye, maniyere dab shishetwotsi geneúshitwonat kup'shosh wotitu keewo ashuwotssh keewwere. <verse eid="EPH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30"/>It kashts aawo b́ kiitstwok'o wotitwo it ats jot'ets Ik' S'ayin Shayiro shiyanik'ayere. <verse eid="EPH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31"/>S'aam woto, nib k'úno, fayo, kúúho, c'ashonat kon naari gond jamo it atsere okaan wokowe. <verse eid="EPH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 3:13">3:13</ref> </char></note> Maniyere it ats atseyosh doowwotsnat maac' nefwotsn, shiyanitwotsnat imetwotsi wotoore, Ik'o Krstosn it morro itsh orowe bí ettsok'o it were it atsatsewosh orowe erre.<verse eid="EPH 4:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Shanotsi beyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1"/>Haniyere okoon shuneets nanaúotskok'o itwere Ik' shuuts sha'irwotsi wotoore, <verse eid="EPH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2"/>Krstos noon b́ shuntsok'onat Ik'o geneúshit sheeng sháák' detsts imonat wosho woshdek't b́ kasho noosh beshidek't b́ imtsok'o itwere shunon beewere,.<verse eid="EPH 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3"/>Han naari keewan Krstiyaniyosh b́ geyirawotse wido wee kon naari kiimo wee jaalo itokere shishek'aye. <verse eid="EPH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4"/>Maniyere dab Ik'osh udo t'intswere bako iritwonat dárts ash keewo, wee aatsni keewu keewo itesh woteratse, hank'o keewan itsh geyiratse. <verse eid="EPH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5"/>Gobetso b́ witiyal, kon naari kim fin finiruwo b́ wotiyal, wee woteraw Ik'o ik'iyok'o wotts jaalo b́ wotiyal, Krstosnat Ik' mengstotse bano b́ dashawok'o dande'ere.<verse eid="EPH 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6"/>Keewanotsatse tuutson aleraw ashuwotsats Ik' fayo b́ wetwotse konwor woteraw keewon itn ant'elck'aye. <verse eid="EPH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7"/>Mansh aleraw ashuwotsnton ik wotk'ayere, <verse eid="EPH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8"/>Yoots it t'alwwotsiye it teshi, andomo doonzok it wotsosh sháán itne mansh sháánon beyiru ashuwotskok'o sha'ore. <verse eid="EPH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9"/>Doo jamo, kááwonat ari shuwo b́ daatset shááanokne. <verse eid="EPH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10"/>Mansh doonzo geneúshit keewo eeg b́ wotok'o p'ec'ar s'iilere. <verse eid="EPH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11"/>Shuu deshaw t'alwi finonton ik wotk'ayere maniyere shááno maants kishde'er kitswere. <verse eid="EPH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12"/>T'alwotse beyiru ashuwots ááshon bok'aliru keewo keewonwor dab jiitsike. <verse eid="EPH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13"/>Jam keewo shááno maants b́ woor eeg b́ arok'o shiratsne b́ be'eti. <verse eid="EPH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14"/>Shiratse be'eyiru jamo shááne, mansh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">«Nee tokrirwono tuuwe! k'irtswotsitse galeyar tuuwe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">Krstoswere neesh c'eeshitwe» eteere.<verse eid="EPH 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15"/>Eshe aawk'o it beyirwok'o t'iwintsde'ere dan teleef danetswotsk'owa bako danteleef deshawwotskok'o beek'ayere. <verse eid="EPH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 4:5">K'ol. 4:5</ref> </char></note> Dúran gond b́ wottsotse itsh imets aawo b́ besheraniyere bín finore.<verse eid="EPH 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17"/>Mansh doonzo shuno eeg b́ wotok'o t'iwintswere bako dartswotsi wotk'ayere.<verse eid="EPH 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18"/>T'afiyo maants itn b́ dametwotse woyiniyon dutsets bíron mashk'ayere, maniyere S'ayin Shayiron s'eenere. <verse eid="EPH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19"/>Duubonat udon, Shayiri jááwonowere it ats atsewo keewewere, it maac'otse kishde jááwar duwr doonzo udoore. <verse eid="EPH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19-20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 3:16-17">K'ol. 3:16-17</ref> </char></note> Jam keewosh no doonzo Iyesus Krstos shútson jam aawo Ik'o Niho udoore.<verse eid="EPH 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kenihonat máátson</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21"/>Krstos mangosha err ititsere iko ikosh alewee.<verse eid="EPH 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:22 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="COL 3:18">K'ol. 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1 P'et'. 3:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Máátswotso! doonzo Iyesussh it aleyrwok'o it kenih kenihosh alewere, <verse eid="EPH 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23"/>Krstos bí ats wotts Ik' mowush took'onat bin kashitwo b́wottsok'o kenihonwere b́ máátsush tooke. <verse eid="EPH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24"/>Ik' moow Krstossh bi aleyirwok'o máátswots jam keewon bo kenihosh alewne.<verse eid="EPH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:25 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="COL 3:19">K'ol. 3:19</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1 P'et'. 3:7</ref> </char>
    </note> Kenihwotso! Krstos Ik' moowu b́ shuntsok'onat b́ tooko bish beshidek't b́ imtsok'o itwere it máátswotsi shunere, <verse eid="EPH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26"/>Krstos han b́ k'al Ik' moow S'ayintsosh geeyatniye, b́ S'ayintswere b́ aap'iweeron aatson mashdek'tniye. <verse eid="EPH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27"/>Hank'on kiimo wee shiits aak'o wee han arts k'osh gond keewo biyatse b́ datserawo S'ayinat biyatse eeg eeg deshaw sheeng woshdek'tniye b́ maants b́ t'intsi. <verse eid="EPH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28"/>Eshe kenihwots bo tooko boshunirwok'o bo mááts máátso shunne, b́ máátsu shunirwo b́ tooke b́ shuniri. <verse eid="EPH 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29"/>B́ took atso shit'etwo konwor aaliye, dab Krstos Ik' moosh b́ k'alirwok'o b́ manziti, b́ dugniti. <verse eid="EPH 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30"/>Noowere Krstos atsi kaywots noone, <verse eid="EPH 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Aze. 2:24</ref> </char></note> «Hank'on asho b́ nihinat bíndn k'ayir b́ máátswats b́ deeshiti, gitetswotswere ik atse bowotiti» eteere. <verse eid="EPH 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32"/>Ááshts keewanwere eene, hanowere t etir Krstosnat Ik' maats aridek'atniye. <verse eid="EPH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33"/>Ernmó keewan itne b́ s'iliri, mansh keniho b́ máátsu b́ tookok'o woshde'er shune, máátsunwere b kenihi mangiwye.<verse eid="EPH 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6"/>
  <para style="s">Ind nihonat nana'i jango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="COL 3:20">K'ol. 3:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Nana'úwotso! doonzo shinatse geyitk b́wottsotse it ind nihosh alewere. <verse eid="EPH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2"/>«Nnihnat nindn mangiwe» etiru alo jangiyets aap'o bítse detsts shints tzaziyo haniye, <verse eid="EPH 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2-3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Kesh. 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Iwi. 5:16</ref> </char></note> Han nk'aliyalowere «Jam keewo neesh kááwitwe, datsanatsnowere nkasho genzitwe.»<verse eid="EPH 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="COL 3:22-25">K'ol. 3:22-25</ref> </char>
    </note> Itwere nihwotso! doonzo Iyesusn boosh niwo danifetsr, kiitsfetsr fayefetsr ditswere bako itnana'i nibo k'úni k'ayere.<verse eid="EPH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Doonzwotsnat guutswots jango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5"/>Guutswotso! meetson itsh doonz wottswotssh shatonat k'ewon kéwewere, Krstossh it aleyirwok'o itnibi kááwon boosh alewere. <verse eid="EPH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6"/>It aletwere Ik'i shuntso it nibon finiru Krstos guutswotskok'o wotde'erni bako asho geneúshosh be'ewosha err wotk'aye. <verse eid="EPH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7"/>Ashosh b́woterawo doonzosh finirwotskok'o wotde'er it shunon shengshde'er finore. <verse eid="EPH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8"/>Guutso wotowa nas' wotowa b́took tookon b́fiints sheeng finosh doonzoke b́ k'awntso dek'etk b́wottsok'o danfte.<verse eid="EPH 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Iwi. 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:25">K'ol. 3:25</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:1">4:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Itwere doonzwotso! ash shiitso s'iilr boga bogshrawo itnat boonsh doonzo darotse b́beyirwok'o gawfetsr sheefo k'ayk'rar it guutswotssh sheengo k'alwere.<verse eid="EPH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik'oke daatset kes'i k'ac'wotsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10"/>Eshe haniyere okoon doonzonat bí angi eenmann kup'ore, <verse eid="EPH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11"/>Dabilos shoobi fino k'efo itfalitwok'o Ik' kes'i k'ac' jamo tahde'ere. <verse eid="EPH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12"/>No kaareyo ashuwotsnton b́woterawo t'aluts dúranatse kewirwotsnton, naashwotsnat datsatsi angwotsnton man etonwere darwotsitse fa'a kim shayirwotsntoniye. <verse eid="EPH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13"/>Eshe gond aawots t'alati ango k'efo it falitwok'onat jametswotsi b́jamon ishr kup'ar need'o it falitwok'o Ik'o kes'i k'ac' jamó k'aa'úde'ere!<verse eid="EPH 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:5">Isa. 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:17">59:17</ref> </char>
    </note> Eshe haniyak arikeewo znaarok'o it gebaats edde'er, kááw wotono t'ururiyok'o<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">T'ururiya: </char><char style="ft">Eto kes'o amewor gerats kardek'ef gino asho b́ koyawok'o bazitke. </char></note> tahade'er, <verse eid="EPH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Isa. 52:7</ref> </char></note> C'aamo geddek'ts wotadarok' jeeni doo shishiyo itdek'tso nabosh k'ande'er need'ore. <verse eid="EPH 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16"/>Jamaniyre danbono taw lalwok'o aat'efre sha'iru diyablos gin jamwotsi bín t'afiyosh it falitwo imnetiyo geepok'o k'aa'úde'ere. <verse eid="EPH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa. 59:17</ref> </char></note> Kash daatsonowere tookats gerdek'ef k'uriya eteetsok'o it tookats gup'sh de'ere, iknwere S'ayin shayiratse daatset shiki gorado bíwere Ik'o aap'etso deshde'ere. <verse eid="EPH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18"/>Uni aawo S'ayin shayiron jishefetsr Ik' k'onon t'intswere. Mank'oon Ik'o S'ayints b́ dek'ts ashuwotssh it baterawon kup'ar Ik'o k'onwere. <verse eid="EPH 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19"/>Dooshishiko ááshts keewo shatalon kishde'er t keewor geyit aap'o keewosh t falituwok'o taashowere Ik'o k'onwere. <verse eid="EPH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20"/>Andoor habiliyon tipeyat dooshiyansh woshek taane, mansh ááw shuk'on tkeewitwok'o taash Ik'o k'onwere.<verse eid="EPH 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'uwaatsi jamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:21 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 20:4">Wosh. 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2 T'im. 4:12</ref> </char>
    </note> Shuneets eshwonat doonzo Iyesus finatsnowere amanets guutso wottso Tikik'os t jango aawk'o b́wottsok'onat eeg t finirwok'o jam keewo itdanetwok'o itsh keewitwe. <verse eid="EPH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 4:7-8">K'ol. 4:7-8</ref> </char></note> Mansh noo aawk'o nowottsok'o itdanetwok'o aaninwere itnoor b́kup'shitwok'owa etaat bín it maants woshere.<verse eid="EPH 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23"/>Ik'o nihonat doonzo Iyesus Krstos jeenonat shunon imnetiyonton eshwotssh wotowe. <verse eid="EPH 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24"/>K'ut'eraw shunon no doonz Iyesus Krstosi shunts jamwotssh s'aato wotowe.<verse eid="EPH 6:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6"/>
</usx>
